+`uiSession.provideProjections(reference, sources)` registers bare observable sources for explicit projection keys of that active Session generation. Every nested Slot and Factory reads them through the framework's standard `useProjection`; other keys and Sessions retain their Controller sources. An undefined snapshot remains unknown. Duplicate providers for a key are rejected atomically. The returned disposer, caller-plugin teardown, or Session-generation teardown restores the Controller sources; the registration neither retains the Session nor changes Host data, logs, input routing, or authorization.
